msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Visningen <strong><em>@type</em></strong> for Editoria11y mangler.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Modulet installerer tre visningskonfigurationer i mappen /config/install. "
"De skal alle være installeret for at vise resultater i dashboardet.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Løsning: kopier indholdet af <strong>/editoria11y/config/install/"
"views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> og indsæt det i en import af typen "
"\"View\" på <a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/"
"import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. Hvis du "
"synkroniserer konfigurationer til filsystemet, skal du inkludere disse Views."
"</p>"

