msgstr "Beskriver denne alt‑tekst billedet eller linket?"

msgid "Are the symbols or emoji in this link meaningful?"
msgstr "Er symboler/emoji i dette link meningsfulde?"

msgid "This link is unpronounceable"
msgstr "Dette link kan ikke udtales"

msgid "Link text should not be a URL"
msgstr "Linktekst må ikke være en URL"

msgid "Meta tag for page language missing"
msgstr "Meta‑tag for sidens sprog mangler"

msgid "Did you mean a different language code?"
msgstr "Mente du en anden sprogkode?"

msgid "Invalid language code"
msgstr "Ugyldig sprogkode"

msgid "Page language may not match the content"
msgstr "Sidens sprog stemmer muligvis ikke overens med indholdet"

msgid "Meta tag limits how much users can enlarge text"
msgstr "Meta‑tag begrænser, hvor meget brugeren kan zoome"

msgid "Meta tag automatically refreshes page"
msgstr "Meta‑tag opdaterer siden automatisk"

msgid "Meta tag prevents users from enlarging text"
msgstr "Meta‑tag forhindrer brugeren i at zoome"

msgid "Meta tag for page title missing"
msgstr "Meta‑tag for sidens titel mangler"

msgid "Invalid HTML: image has no alt attribute"
msgstr "Ugyldig HTML: billede uden alt‑attribut"

msgid "Invalid HTML: linked image missing alt attribute"
msgstr "Ugyldig HTML: billede i link uden alt‑attribut"

msgid "Invalid HTML: image in link missing alt attribute"
msgstr "Ugyldig HTML: billede i link mangler alt‑attribut"

msgid "This link target may be invalid"
msgstr "Denne linkdestination kan være ugyldig"

msgid "Should this quote be a heading?"
msgstr "Skal dette citat være en overskrift?"

msgid "Has this document been tagged for screen readers?"
msgstr "Er dette dokument tagget til skærmlæsere?"

msgid "Should this bold text be a heading?"
msgstr "Skal denne fede tekst være en overskrift?"

msgid "Should this have list formatting?"
msgstr "Skal dette formateres som en liste?"

msgid "Broken same-page link"
msgstr "Ugyldigt internt link"

msgid "Do not justify text"
msgstr "Brug ikke fuldjusteret tekst"

msgid "Nested interactive layout components"
msgstr "Indlejrede interaktive komponenter"

msgid "Is there an alternative for this PDF?"
msgstr "Findes der et alternativ til denne PDF?"

msgid "Text is too small"
msgstr "Teksten er for lille"

msgid "Large blocks of emphasized text are harder to read"
msgstr "Store blokke med fremhævet tekst er svære at læse"

msgid "Do not use sub/superscript as visual formatting"
msgstr "Brug ikke hævet/sænket skrift som ren visuel styling"

msgid "Only links should be underlined"
msgstr "Kun links bør være understreget"

msgid "Is this uppercase text needed?"
msgstr "Er denne tekst med STORE bogstaver nødvendig?"

msgid "Are there redundant words in this alt text?"
msgstr "Er der overflødige ord i denne alt‑tekst?"

msgid "Tabindex overrides interrupt the focus order"
msgstr "Tilsidesættelser af tabindex forstyrrer fokusrækkefølgen"

msgid "This header cell needs text"
msgstr "Denne tabeloverskriftscelle skal indeholde tekst"

msgid "This table has an invalid headers attribute"
msgstr "Denne tabel har et ugyldigt headers‑attribut"

msgid "This table needs a header row and/or column"
msgstr "Denne tabel mangler række‑ og/eller kolonneoverskrifter"

msgid "Content headings should not be used inside tables"
msgstr "Indholdsoverskrifter bør ikke bruges inde i tabeller"

msgid "Invalid HTML list"
msgstr "Ugyldig HTML‑liste"

msgid "Linked images"
msgstr "Linkede billeder"

msgid "Text formatting"
msgstr "Tekstformatering"

msgid "Video, audio, frames"
msgstr "Video, lyd, rammer"

msgid "Contrast"
msgstr "Kontrast"

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formularer"

msgid "ARIA and focus"
msgstr "ARIA og fokus"

msgid "Page metadata"
msgstr "Sidemetadata"

msgid "The request could not be processed. Details have been logged."
msgstr "Anmodningen kunne ikke behandles. Detaljerne er blevet logget."

msgid "API request rejected: @message"
msgstr "API-anmodning afvist: @message"

msgid "API request failed: @message"
msgstr "API-anmodning mislykkedes: @message"

msgid "Export pages with alerts"
msgstr "Eksportér sider med advarsler"

msgid ""
"Install the Editoria11y Export Batch Processor module to download these "
"reports."
msgstr "Installer Editoria11y Export Batch Processor-modulet for at downloade disse rapporter."

msgid "Export results"
msgstr "Eksportér resultater"

msgctxt "problems"
msgid "Top alerts"
msgstr "Vigtigste problemer"

msgctxt "problems"
msgid "Pages with the most alerts"
msgstr "Sider med flest problemer"

msgid "Recent dismissals"
msgstr "Seneste afvisninger"

msgid ""
"Activate the <a href=\"@csa\">Editoria11y CSA submodule</a> to see developer "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér <a href=\"@csa\">undermodulet Editoria11y CSA</a> for at se "
"udviklertests."

msgid "Include all parts of the page that contain your theme and content."
msgstr "Inkludér alle dele af siden, der indeholder dit tema og indhold."

msgid "Include all parts of the page that contain your editable content."
msgstr "Inkludér alle dele af siden, der indeholder dit redigerbare indhold."

msgid "Exclude elements that show unhelpful, repetitive, or inaccurate alerts."
msgstr ""
"Ekskludér elementer, der viser ikke-nyttige, gentagne eller unøjagtige "
"advarsler."

msgid ""
"<a href=\"@permissions\">Add permissions</a>, especially \"View Editoria11y "
"checker\" and \"Mark OK.\"</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@permissions\">Tildel tilladelser</a>, især \"View Editoria11y "
"checker\" og \"Mark OK\".</a>"

msgid ""
"If you need help: <a href=\"@config_guide\">Configuration Guide</a> | <a "
"href=\"@issue_queue\">Issue Queue</a> | <a href=\"@help\">Support contacts</"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"Hvis du har brug for hjælp: <a href=\"@config_guide\">Konfigurationsguide</"
"a> | <a href=\"@issue_queue\">Issue-oversigt</a> | <a "
"href=\"@help\">Supportkontakter</a>"

msgid "Autodetect"
msgstr "Autodetekter"

msgid "Only user-editable content"
msgstr "Kun brugerrediger­bart indhold"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "Andet"

msgid "Parts of the page to test"
msgstr "Dele af siden der skal testes"

msgid "\"Autodetect\" selects:"
msgstr "\"Autodetekter\" vælger:"

msgid "Other: specify regions to check for developer and content problems"
msgstr ""
"Andet: angiv områder, der skal tjekkes for udvikler- og indholdsproblemer"

msgid ""
"Provide CSS selectors. For many sites, the site theme is wrapped in "
"<code>.dialog-off-canvas-main-canvas</code> while editing."
msgstr ""
"Angiv CSS‑selectorer. På mange sites er sitets tema pakket ind i "
"<code>.dialog-off-canvas-main-canvas</code> under redigering."

msgid "Do not check for any errors inside these elements"
msgstr "Tjek ikke for nogen fejl inde i disse elementer"

msgid "These parts of the page will be ignored entirely."
msgstr "Disse dele af siden vil blive helt ignoreret."

msgid "match content settings"
msgstr "match content settings"

msgid "Page regions with user-editable content"
msgstr "Sideområder med brugerrediger­bart indhold"

msgid ""
"Default: <code><em>main</em></code><br>Provide <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/CSS/Building_blocks/"
"Selectors\">CSS selectors</a>. Content authors will only see the alerts "
"within these parts of the page. Do not provide selectors that nest within "
"each other, or the inner content will be checked twice."
msgstr ""
"Standard: <code><em>main</em></code><br>Angiv <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/CSS/Building_blocks/"
"Selectors\">CSS‑selectorer</a>. Indholdsredaktører ser kun advarsler inden "
"for disse dele af siden. Undgå indlejrede selectorer, da det indre indhold "
"ellers kontrolleres to gange."

msgid ""
"Default: <code><em>main</em></code><br>Provide <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/CSS/Building_blocks/"
"Selectors\">CSS selectors</a>. Do not provide selectors that nest within "
"each other, or the inner content will be checked twice."
msgstr ""
"Standard: <code><em>main</em></code><br>Angiv <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/CSS/Building_blocks/"
"Selectors\">CSS‑selectorer</a>. Undgå indlejrede selectorer, da det indre "
"indhold ellers kontrolleres to gange."

msgid "Errors in these elements should only be shown to developers"
msgstr "Fejl i disse elementer skal kun vises til udviklere"

msgid "Do not check for content errors inside these elements"
msgstr "Tjek ikke for indholdsfejl inde i disse elementer"

msgid ""
"Content editors are not responsible for errors in these elements. <br>E.g.: "
"<code><em>#sidebar-menu a, .slide [aria-hidden=\"true\"]</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Indholdsredaktører er ikke ansvarlige for fejl i disse elementer. "
"<br>F.eks.: <code><em>#sidebar-menu a, .slide [aria-hidden=\"true\"]</em></"
"code>."

msgid "Roles that will see developer alerts"
msgstr "Roller der ser udvikleradvarsler"

msgid ""
"All roles with the <a href=\":url\">View editoria11y checker</a> permission "
"see content alerts."
msgstr ""
"Alle roller med tilladelsen <a href=\":url\">View editoria11y checker</a> "
"ser indholdsadvarsler."

msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Avancerede indstillinger"

msgid "Assertiveness"
msgstr "Påtrængenhed"

msgid "Checker mode for content roles"
msgstr "Kontroltilstand for indholdsroller"

msgid "Start open if there are any alerts"
msgstr "Start åbent hvis der er advarsler"

msgid "Start open if there are new alerts"
msgstr "Start åbent hvis der er nye advarsler"

msgid "Start minimized"
msgstr "Start minimeret"

msgid ""
"Choose when the control panel should open and show inline tips. \"Start open "
"if there are any alerts\" is recommended, as it helps tips get noticed over "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Vælg hvornår kontrolpanelet skal åbne og vise tips. \"Start åbent hvis der "
"er advarsler\" anbefales, da det gør tips mere synlige."

msgid "Checker mode for developer roles"
msgstr "Kontroltilstand for udviklerroller"

msgid "Do not check any content while it is being edited"
msgstr "Kontrollér ikke indhold mens det redigeres"

msgid ""
"Use the \"Do not check on pages with these elements\" setting to prevent "
"checking only on specific pages. E.g., exclude: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-"
"article\"]</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Brug indstillingen \"Kontrollér ikke sider med disse elementer\" for kun at "
"udelade bestemte sider. Fx: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-article\"]</em></code>."

msgid "Assign headers to CKEditor tables on insert"
msgstr "Tilføj tabeloverskrifter ved indsættelse i CKEditor"

msgid "First row"
msgstr "Første række"

msgid "First column"
msgstr "Første kolonne"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "Begge"

msgid ""
"You will need to clear cache for changes to this setting to appear in "
"CKEditor."
msgstr "Du skal rydde cache for at ændringerne vises i CKEditor."

msgid "Theme compatibility"
msgstr "Tema‑kompatibilitet"

msgid "Configuration tips"
msgstr "Konfigurations‑tips"

msgid ""
"If the checker <strong>toggle</strong> does not appear: make sure a z-"
"indexed or overflow-hidden element in your front-end theme is not hiding or "
"covering the <code><em>ed11y-element-panel</em></code> container, make sure "
"that any custom selectors in the \"Disable the scanner if these elements are "
"detected\" field are not present, and make sure that no JavaScript errors "
"are appearing in your <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/"
"Tools/Browser_Console\"> browser console</a>"
msgstr ""
"Hvis <strong>kontrolknappen</strong> ikke vises: kontrollér om et element "
"med z-index eller overflow:hidden i dit tema skjuler <code><em>ed11y-element-"
"panel</em></code>, verificér at ingen af de brugerdefinerede selectorer i "
"feltet \"Deaktivér scanner hvis disse elementer findes\" er til stede, og "
"kontrollér at der ikke vises JavaScript-fejl i din <a href=\"https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Tools/Browser_Console\">browserkonsol</a>."

msgid ""
"If the checker toggle is present but <strong>not detecting</strong> errors, "
"or missing errors that should be flagged: check that your inclusions & "
"exclusion settings below are not missing or ignoring the elements. It is not "
"uncommon for homepages or views to insert editable content outside the "
"<code><em>main</em></code> element."
msgstr ""
"Hvis kontrolknappen vises men <strong>ikke finder</strong> fejl, eller "
"overser fejl der burde markeres: gennemgå dine indstillinger for inklusion "
"og eksklusion for at sikre at elementerne ikke udelades. Det er almindeligt "
"at forsider og views placerer redigerbart indhold uden for <code><em>main</"
"em></code>."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

msgid "Sleek"
msgstr "Sleek"

msgid "Classic"
msgstr "Classic"

msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Dark"

msgid "Do not check on pages with these elements"
msgstr "Kontrollér ikke sider der indeholder disse elementer"

msgid ""
"Used to block checking on site sections or admin pages.<br>E.g. "
"<code><em>.content-type-example, .tabs__link[href=*\"edit\"]</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Bruges til at forhindre kontrol af visse sektioner eller admin‑sider.<br>Fx: "
"<code><em>.content-type-example, .tabs__link[href=*\"edit\"]</em></code>."

msgid "Hide all alerts on pages where these elements are not present"
msgstr "Skjul alle advarsler på sider hvor disse elementer ikke findes"

msgid ""
"Used to limit alerting to nodes where the user can edit something. Suggested "
"selectors:<br> <code><em>.contextual-region a[href*=\"/edit\"], .contextual-"
"region a[href*=\"/manage\"]</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Bruges til at begrænse advarsler til sider hvor brugeren kan redigere. "
"Foreslåede selectorer:<br><code><em>.contextual-region a[href*=\"/"
"edit\"], .contextual-region a[href*=\"/manage\"]</em></code>."

msgid ""
"Set to the number of other themes or modules that will be <a href=\"https://"
"editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#customtests\">injecting custom "
"result JS events</a>."
msgstr ""
"Angiv antallet af temaer eller moduler der vil <a href=\"https://"
"editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#customtests\">indsprøjte "
"brugerdefinerede resultat‑JS‑events</a>."

msgid "Positioning"
msgstr "Placering"

msgid "Don't show edit links on tips in these containers"
msgstr "Vis ikke redigeringslinks i tips inden for disse containere"

msgid ""
"Tips show copies of the \"Edit\" and \"Layout\" links for nodes, users and "
"taxonomy terms. These links are not helpful on lists of content from remote "
"nodes.<br>Provide a comma-separated list of page sections of where these "
"links should not show, E.g.: <code><em>#sidebar-menu, .news-feed</em></code>."
"<br>To hide the links <strong>everywhere</strong>, set this field to an "
"asterisk (<code><em>*</em></code>).<br>To modify the links, <a "
"href=\"https://editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/#modify-tips\" "
"target=\"_blank\">use the ed11yPop event</a> in your theme JS."
msgstr ""
"Tips viser kopier af \"Redigér\"‑ og \"Layout\"‑links for noder, brugere og "
"taksonomitermen. Disse links er ikke nyttige i lister med eksternt indhold."
"<br>Angiv en kommasepareret liste over sektioner hvor links ikke bør vises, "
"fx: <code><em>#sidebar-menu, .news-feed</em></code>.<br>For at skjule links "
"<strong>overalt</strong>, brug en stjerne (<code><em>*</em></code>).<br>For "
"at tilpasse links, <a href=\"https://editoria11y.princeton.edu/configuration/"
"#modify-tips\" target=\"_blank\">brug ed11yPop‑eventet</a> i dit tema."

msgid "Pin panel to..."
msgstr "Fastgør panel til..."

msgid "Right"
msgstr "Højre"

msgid "Left"
msgstr "Venstre"

msgid "Don't cover these other widgets"
msgstr "Dæk ikke disse andre elementer"

msgid ""
"Provide a comma-separated list of selectors for other things that appear in "
"the bottom right of the page. <br>If nothing is set, Editoria11y will "
"automatically slide left to accommodate <code><em>#klaro_toggle_dialog, "
"#klaro-cookie-notice .same-page-preview-dialog.ui-dialog-position-side</em></"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"Angiv en kommasepareret liste med selectorer for andre elementer der vises "
"nederst til højre.<br>Hvis intet er angivet, flytter Editoria11y sig "
"automatisk til venstre for at undgå <code><em>#klaro_toggle_dialog, #klaro-"
"cookie-notice .same-page-preview-dialog.ui-dialog-position-side</em></code>."

msgid "Elements with overflow hidden"
msgstr "Elementer med overflow:hidden"

msgid ""
"Sometimes buttons get drawn and visually truncated outside the bounds of a "
"positioned element. Provide a selector list."
msgstr ""
"Knapper kan undertiden blive afskåret uden for grænserne af et positioneret "
"element. Angiv selectorer."

msgid "Theme JS will handle revealing hidden tooltips inside these containers"
msgstr "Temaets JS håndterer visning af skjulte værktøjstip i disse containere"

msgid ""
"Editoria11y detects hidden tooltips and warns the user when they try to jump "
"to them from the panel. For elements on this list, Editoria11y will <a "
"href=\"https://itmaybejj.github.io/editoria11y/#dealing-with-alerts-on-"
"hidden-or-size-constrained-content\">dispatch a JS event</a> instead of a "
"warning, so custom JS in your theme can first reveal the hidden tip (e.g., "
"open an accordion or tab panel)."
msgstr ""
"Editoria11y registrerer skjulte værktøjstip og advarer brugeren når de "
"forsøger at hoppe til dem fra panelet. For elementer i denne liste sender "
"Editoria11y et <a href=\"https://itmaybejj.github.io/editoria11y/#dealing-"
"with-alerts-on-hidden-or-size-constrained-content\">JS‑event</a> i stedet "
"for en advarsel, så dit temas JS kan vise tip’et (fx åbne et accordion eller "
"panel)."

msgid "Detecting dynamic and shadow content"
msgstr "Registrering af dynamisk og shadow‑indhold"

msgid "Dynamically refresh if new content appears"
msgstr "Opdatér dynamisk hvis nyt indhold dukker op"

msgid "Watch for changes anywhere on the page"
msgstr "Overvåg ændringer overalt på siden"

msgid "Only watch for changes to content containers present on load"
msgstr "Overvåg kun ændringer i indholdscontainere der findes ved indlæsning"

msgid "Do not watch for changes"
msgstr "Overvåg ikke ændringer"

msgid ""
"Set to \"anywhere\" if changes are being missed, set to \"ignore\" if you "
"notice performance issues. Themes and modules can also call "
"<code>Drupal.Ed11y.refresh()</code> to refresh results."
msgstr ""
"Sæt til \"anywhere\" hvis ændringer ikke registreres; sæt til \"ignore\" "
"hvis det påvirker ydeevnen. Temaer og moduler kan også kalde "
"<code>Drupal.Ed11y.refresh()</code>."

msgid "Check inside these specific Web components"
msgstr "Kontrollér disse specifikke webkomponenter"

msgid ""
"Provide selectors for elements with <a href='https://developer.mozilla.org/"
"en-US/docs/Web/Web_Components'>shadow DOM</a> you want tested. E.g.: "
"<code><em>my-fancy-accordion-widget, my-magical-slideshow</em></code>."
msgstr ""
"Angiv selectorer for elementer med <a href='https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/Web_Components'>shadow DOM</a> som skal testes. Fx: <code><em>my-"
"fancy-accordion-widget, my-magical-slideshow</em></code>."

msgid "Auto-detect any Web components"
msgstr "Registrér automatisk alle webkomponenter"

msgid ""
"This is easier to configure than specifying components, but may slow test "
"runs on very complicated pages."
msgstr ""
"Dette er nemmere end at specificere komponenter, men kan gøre test "
"langsommere på meget komplekse sider."

msgid "Syncing results to reports"
msgstr "Synkronisering af resultater til rapporter"

msgid ""
"Remember that results only sync to the dashboard when viewing nodes. Results "
"shown while editing or viewing previews or revisions will not sync."
msgstr ""
"Husk at resultater kun synkroniseres til dashboardet når noder vises. "
"Resultater under redigering, forhåndsvisning eller revisioner synkroniseres "
"ikke."

msgid "Remove redundant base url from URLs"
msgstr "Fjern overflødig basis‑URL fra adresser"

msgid ""
"Provide base URL (\"/mysite\") if your site is installed in a subdirectory. "
"Subdirectories tend to get duplicated (/mysite/mysite/mypage) and throw "
"errors from the API."
msgstr ""
"Angiv basis‑URL (\"/mysite\") hvis sitet ligger i et underkatalog. "
"Underkataloger kan fordobles (/mysite/mysite/mypage) og give API‑fejl."

msgid "Preserve query parameters"
msgstr "Bevar queryparametre"

msgid ""
"The dashboard ignores most parameters: results for both /news?f=1 and /news?"
"f=2 will show up as just /news. Provide a comma separated list of parameters "
"that are meaningful, and should appear as separate pages in results."
msgstr ""
"Dashboardet ignorerer de fleste parametre: /news?f=1 og /news?f=2 vises blot "
"som /news. Angiv de parametre der er betydningsfulde og skal bruges som "
"separate sider."

msgid "Disable sync altogether"
msgstr "Deaktivér synkronisering helt"

msgid ""
"Syncing test results back to Drupal is required for the <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y\">issue</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"/admin/reports/editoria11y/dismissals\">dismissal</a> dashboards and "
"\"mark OK\" buttons."
msgstr ""
"Synkronisering af testresultater tilbage til Drupal er påkrævet for "
"dashboards for <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/admin/reports/"
"editoria11y\">problemer</a> og <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/admin/reports/"
"editoria11y/dismissals\">afvisninger</a> samt \"markér OK\"‑knapper."

msgid "Heading outline position of editable content"
msgstr "Overskriftsniveau for redigerbart indhold"

msgid ""
"To check headings in CKEditor, Editoria11y needs to know what the first "
"heading level should be in this field. Body fields should generally be at "
"the h2 level."
msgstr ""
"For at kontrollere overskrifter i CKEditor skal Editoria11y kende det "
"korrekte første niveau. Brødtekstfelter bør normalt starte på h2."

msgid "H2 level fields (body content)"
msgstr "H2‑niveau felter (brødtekst)"

msgid ""
"Body fields on nodes are preceded by an h1, and their heading outline should "
"start with an h2. Ideally set this for top-level body fields for each of "
"your content types, and set blocks and embedded nodes to h3 or h4.\n"
"        <br>Set all content types: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Set specific content types: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-"
"body-wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"        <br>Set up for Gutenberg: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .is-root-container</em></code>"
msgstr ""
"Brødtekstfelter på noder følger efter en h1 og bør starte ved h2. Sæt dette "
"for top‑niveau brødtekstfelter, og brug h3/h4 for blokke og indlejrede "
"noder.\n"
"<br>Alle indholdstyper: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-wrapper .ck-"
"content</em></code>\n"
"<br>Specifikke indholdstyper: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-"
"wrapper .ck-content</em></code>\n"
"<br>Gutenberg: <code><em>form[id^=\"node-\"] #edit-body-wrapper .is-root-"
"container</em></code>"

msgid "H3 level fields (blocks or paragraphs with separate titles)"
msgstr "H3‑niveau felter (blokke og afsnit med egne titler)"

